  <metadata>
    <name>Gusinje – Grebaje Valley (GU02)</name>
    <desc>Cycling trail GU02 is 8.8 km long and leads from Gusinje through Prokletije National Park. It has a total ascent of 279 m, a mostly asphalt surface, and takes about 1 h 10 min without breaks. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
